# ─── Build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
artifacts/

# ─── IDE / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ─── Logs & test results ─────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.trx

# ─── Secrets & local environment ─────────────────────────────────
# Only Development/Testing settings are tracked
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Development.json
!appsettings.Testing.json
.env
.env.local
!.env.example

# ─── Tooling caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.dotnet/
.nuget/
# Python cache (hooks)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ─── Claude Code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# settings.json is shared; local/personal settings are not tracked
.claude/settings.local.json
# Company-internal assets — never publish to the public repo
# (.claude/local/README.md + KIT_DEVIATIONS.md stay tracked; only doc-templates/ is ignored)
.claude/local/doc-templates/
newdocs/

# ─── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Backups ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.orig

# ─── /verify run artifacts (.claude/commands/verify.md → Phase 6) ─
# Ignore heavy binaries (runner/ traces+videos+screenshots, report/html/,
# run metadata) but TRACK the durable text: top-level *.txt,
# report/results.json, and everything under evidence/.
# The 3 primary deliverables (VERIFY_REPORT.md, VERIFY_MATRIX.md,
# verify-artifact.lock) live directly under reports/ and stay tracked.
reports/verify-artifacts/**
!reports/verify-artifacts/
!reports/verify-artifacts/*.txt
!reports/verify-artifacts/report/
!reports/verify-artifacts/report/results.json
!reports/verify-artifacts/report/phase2-results.json
!reports/verify-artifacts/report/phase4-nfr.json

# ─── /test run artifacts (.claude/commands/test.md → Run artifacts) ─
# Same policy as verify-artifacts: ignore heavy binaries, track text results.
reports/test-artifacts/**
!reports/test-artifacts/
!reports/test-artifacts/report/
!reports/test-artifacts/report/results.json
!reports/test-artifacts/report/*.trx
!reports/verify-artifacts/evidence/
!reports/verify-artifacts/evidence/**
reports/verify-artifacts/report/html/
reports/verify-artifacts/runner/
# Personal/repo-local rules (EXTENSION — never published)
.claude/local/CLAUDE.local.md
